% VLT</td><td class="vt-compare__td">Up to 71%</td><td class="vt-compare__td vt-compare__td--stat">99%</td><td class="vt-compare__td vt-compare__td--stat">Lifetime/12yr</td></tr><tr class="vt-compare__row"><td class="vt-compare__td vt-compare__td--name"><span class="vt-compare__pill" style="background:#8B6914">Safety</span><span class="vt-compare__series-name">SpectraSelect Safety</span></td><td class="vt-compare__td">Vista</td><td class="vt-compare__td vt-compare__td--stat">~60% VLT</td><td class="vt-compare__td">Up to 65%</td><td class="vt-compare__td vt-compare__td--stat">99%</td><td class="vt-compare__td vt-compare__td--stat">Lifetime/12yr</td></tr><tr class="vt-compare__row"><td class="vt-compare__td vt-compare__td--name"><span class="vt-compare__pill" style="background:#6E9640">Context</span><span class="vt-compare__series-name">ATC 70</span></td><td class="vt-compare__td">LLumar</td><td class="vt-compare__td vt-compare__td--stat">70% VLT</td><td class="vt-compare__td">Up to 74%</td><td class="vt-compare__td vt-compare__td--stat">99%</td><td class="vt-compare__td vt-compare__td--stat">Lifetime/15yr</td></tr><tr class="vt-compare__row"><td class="vt-compare__td vt-compare__td--name"><span class="vt-compare__pill" style="background:#777">Context</span><span class="vt-compare__series-name">Prestige PR70</span></td><td class="vt-compare__td">3M</td><td class="vt-compare__td vt-compare__td--stat">69% VLT</td><td class="vt-compare__td">~66% TSER</td><td class="vt-compare__td vt-compare__td--stat">99.9%</td><td class="vt-compare__td vt-compare__td--stat">Lifetime/15yr</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="vt-compare__note">Source: Vista by Eastman product bulletins; LLumar ATC spec; 3M Prestige TDS.</p><div class="vt-compare__cta"><a href="/contact/" class="pp-btn pp-btn--primary" style="background:#81AB4C;border-color:#81AB4C;color:#fff">Talk to our team about which series fits your project</a></div></div></section>


